[00:00.500]I won't wait for you
{"我不会为你等待"}
[00:03.500]It's the middle of the night
{"此刻已是深夜时分"}
[00:04.500]But the street lights keep me awake
{"但街灯让我辗转难眠"}
[00:08.000]I feel like a fool
{"感觉自己像个傻瓜"}
[00:11.500]'Cause I leave the window open and my bones still shake
{"因为我敞着窗户　骨头仍在颤抖"}
